user_prompt_template:
CHAPTER NARRATIVE (source of truth):
{chapter_narrative}

CHAPTER PLAN:
{current_chapter_json}

PROJECT CONTEXT:
Tutorial Request: {life_event}
Document: {document_title}
Skill Level: {audience}
Output Style: {tone}
